    "Licence shall be re-introduced, but as a CLASS Licence with Licence terms and conditions set by the Authority including provisions for record keeping, logging-in software, CCTV surveillance, as well as identification of persons accessing the service point/facility. H. DATA CENTRES H.1. Current Status 71. Data Centers in Kenya are primarily established in two different ways, namely: 16 71.1. Fully-fledged data centres complete with space, power supply, connectivity, air conditioning, security and",
