    "nce Bill 2019 proposed to re-introduce the turnover tax which was abolished and replaced with presumptive tax by Finance Act of 2018. The turnover tax shall be payable by any resident whose turnover from business does not exceed or is not expected to exceed five million during the year of income. However the turnover tax will not apply to rental income, management or professional or training fees, income from of incorporated companies or any other income subject to final withholding tax. Re-intr",
