    "ards Body in the region. b) The product enjoys consumer confidence. c) The product quality is underpinned by the national quality system. 15. What are the charges for certification to the various firm categories under the Standardization Mark? For Fortification Mark, additional fee of ksh 20,000 is applicable Note that payments are exclusive of VAT. 16. What are the turnover limits/firm categories for LME, MME and SME? LME - Large Manufacturing Enterprise: Annual turnover over Kshs 500,000 MME -",
