    "SOURCE: https://pesaflow.com/ KB: kb3_financing_credit SCRAPED: July 2026 Home | Pesaflow Pesaflow is a pioneering technology company delivering exceptional Payment Solutions and Automations for People, Enterprises and Governments across Africa. We solve some of Africa’s biggest challenges through home-grown solutions. We believe in Africa’s ability to solve its own shortcomings and realise its real economic potential. Your key technology partner in: Digital Payment Settlements Whether you have",
